{"id":"south-india-ghats","title":"South India: Western Ghats by motorcycle","who":"Classic route · Karnataka, Tamil Nadu and Kerala","when":"September to March","vehicle":"Royal Enfield or any motorcycle, 8–12 days","kind":"moto","color":"#16a34a","summary":"From Bengaluru through Mysuru's palace and the coffee hills of Coorg, the forests of Wayanad, the hairpins up to Ooty and Kodaikanal, the tea estates of Munnar, then down to Kerala's backwaters and Kochi. Twisty, green and full of spices.","sources":[{"label":"Vintage Rides: The Spices Route, a travel story","url":"https://www.vintagerides.com/gb/blog/the-spices-route-a-travel-story-by-paul-ollett/"},{"label":"xBHP: the southern escapade, riding solo across 5 states","url":"https://www.xbhp.com/talkies/tourer/30136-the-southern-escapade-riding-solo-across-5-states"}],"approximate":"A common loop of hill stations; the roads are the router's choice.","km":1134,"bbox":[75.7388,9.4606,77.59,12.9765],"stops":[{"name":"Bengaluru","place":"Bengaluru, Karnataka","at":[12.9768,77.5901],"text":"Out of the big city early to beat the traffic.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/UB_City%2C_Bangalore.JPG/500px-UB_City%2C_Bangalore.JPG","page":"Bengaluru","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:UB_City%2C_Bangalore.JPG","credit":"Prateek Karandikar","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Mysuru","place":"Mysuru, Karnataka","at":[12.3041,76.653],"text":"The maharajas' palace, lit up on Sunday nights.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Mysore_Palace_Morning.jpg/500px-Mysore_Palace_Morning.jpg","page":"Mysore Palace","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mysore_Palace_Morning.jpg","credit":"Muhammad Mahdi Karim","license":"GFDL 1.2"}},{"name":"Coorg","place":"Madikeri, Karnataka","at":[12.4215,75.7388],"text":"Coffee estates and misty hills in Kodagu.","source":{"label":"xBHP: southern escapade","url":"https://www.xbhp.com/talkies/tourer/30136-the-southern-escapade-riding-solo-across-5-states"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/Tadiandamol_Valley%2C_Western_Ghats.jpg/500px-Tadiandamol_Valley%2C_Western_Ghats.jpg","page":"Kodagu district","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tadiandamol_Valley%2C_Western_Ghats.jpg","credit":"Jyotirmoy","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Wayanad","place":"Kalpetta, Kerala","at":[11.6103,76.0828],"text":"Forest roads where elephants cross, and spice gardens.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Blue%2C_Green_%26_White.jpg/500px-Blue%2C_Green_%26_White.jpg","page":"Wayanad district","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Blue%2C_Green_%26_White.jpg","credit":"Karkiabhijeet","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Ooty","place":"Ooty, Tamil Nadu","at":[11.4127,76.7031],"text":"Up the 36 hairpins from Masinagudi to the Nilgiri hill station.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Ooty_lake.jpg/500px-Ooty_lake.jpg","page":"Ooty","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ooty_lake.jpg","credit":"Vinayaraj","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Kodaikanal","place":"Kodaikanal, Tamil Nadu","at":[10.2337,77.492],"text":"Down to the plains and up again into the Palani hills.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Boating_in_Kodaikanal_Lake_with_Mist.jpg/500px-Boating_in_Kodaikanal_Lake_with_Mist.jpg","page":"Kodaikanal","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Boating_in_Kodaikanal_Lake_with_Mist.jpg","credit":"KARTY JazZ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Munnar","place":"Munnar, Kerala","at":[10.087,77.0601],"text":"Tea estates on every slope.","source":{"label":"Vintage Rides: The Spices Route","url":"https://www.vintagerides.com/gb/blog/the-spices-route-a-travel-story-by-paul-ollett/"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Munnar_Overview.jpg/500px-Munnar_Overview.jpg","page":"Munnar","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Munnar_Overview.jpg","credit":"Kondephy","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}},{"name":"Alappuzha","place":"Alappuzha, Kerala","at":[9.5003,76.4123],"text":"The backwaters: a night on a houseboat while the bike rests.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Alappuzha_Boat_Beauty_W.jpg/500px-Alappuzha_Boat_Beauty_W.jpg","page":"Alappuzha","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alappuzha_Boat_Beauty_W.jpg","credit":"Augustus Binu/ facebook","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"}},{"name":"Kochi","place":"Fort Kochi, Kerala","at":[9.9676,76.2422],"text":"Chinese fishing nets and the old spice-trading quarter.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Kochi%2C_Fishing_nets_at_sunset%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg/500px-Kochi%2C_Fishing_nets_at_sunset%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg","page":"Fort Kochi","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kochi%2C_Fishing_nets_at_sunset%2C_Kerala%2C_India.jpg","credit":"Vyacheslav Argenberg","license":"CC BY 4.0"}}],"legs":[{"by":"ride","km":141,"line":[[12.9765,77.59],[12.8971,77.4616],[12.7804,77.3686],[12.7445,77.3091],[12.7485,77.2558],[12.6454,77.1725],[12.6274,77.105],[12.5472,76.9591],[12.5443,76.8742],[12.5162,76.858],[12.4897,76.7831],[12.3982,76.6694],[12.3039,76.6525]]},{"by":"ride","km":119,"line":[[12.3039,76.6525],[12.36,76.5395],[12.3344,76.4912],[12.3469,76.4276],[12.3082,76.3114],[12.3144,76.2299],[12.3396,76.188],[12.3366,76.0853],[12.4575,75.9604],[12.4326,75.8911],[12.4527,75.8309],[12.4213,75.7388]]},{"by":"ride","km":130,"line":[[12.4213,75.7388],[12.3596,75.7601],[12.3171,75.7554],[12.3037,75.793],[12.2723,75.8129],[12.1966,75.9303],[12.0676,75.9443],[12.0049,76.004],[11.9737,76.014],[11.9528,76.0651],[11.881,76.0781],[11.7852,76.0453],[11.7206,76.0802],[11.6103,76.0828]]},{"by":"ride","km":118,"line":[[11.6103,76.0828],[11.638,76.0937],[11.6603,76.1621],[11.6632,76.2701],[11.61